<br>
&nbsp; | -- Downloading CPM.cmake to ...bit7z/4.0.11/build/cpm_cache/cpm/CP=
M_0.42.0.cmake<br>
&nbsp; | CMake Error at cmake/Dependencies.cmake:15 (file):<br>
&nbsp; |&nbsp;&nbsp; file DOWNLOAD cannot compute hash on failed download<b=
