.com/cpm-cmake/CPM.cmake/releases/download/v0.42.0/CPM.cmake</a>&quot;<br>
&nbsp; |&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; status: [6;&quot;Could not resolve hostnam=
e&quot;]<br>
<br>
&nbsp; So change ${B}/cmake to ${B}/cpm_cache/cpm/ to fix this issue.<br>
&nbsp; ./build/cpm_cache/cpm/CPM_0.42.0.cmake<br>
<br>
